### Framework: Next.js 16.2.6 (App Router)
The project uses the modern Next.js App Router architecture, which requires:
- SpeedInsights component in root layout (`app/layout.tsx`)
- Import from `@vercel/speed-insights/next`
- Component rendered inside `<body>` tag

**Current implementation satisfies all requirements.**

